/**
 * Cooperative trial groups moved from institution records of type "consortium" to company records of type
 * "cooperative-group" (docs/IMPROVEMENTS-100.md row 251, 25 September 2026), so every group that sponsors trials has one
 * home: the company record carries sponsor linking (trial companyKeys, src/data/sponsor-aliases.ts and the registry
 * matcher in scripts/fetch-entity-trials.ts), and the OpenAlex research output, people, member centres, website,
 * country, founding year and aliases the institution record held come with it. Ids are unchanged, so the research
 * snapshots under public/openalex/research/<id>.json and the logos still apply; the old /institutions/<id>/ routes
 * redirect (vercel.json and public/institutions/<id>/index.html).
 *
 * Text, links and `asOf` are as the institution records left them (src/data/groups.ts of 6 September, institutions/bodies.ts
 * of 9 September, institutions.ts, china.ts and paediatric-fronts.ts); `founded` is copied from the year each summary
 * states; `programs` became `notes`; the drugs a group tested moved from `drugs` (a company's products) to `related`;
 * links to other groups moved from `institutions` to `companies`. Registry lead-sponsor spellings added to `aka` are
 * those ClinicalTrials.gov prints for the group.
 *
 * Registered in src/data/index.ts beside companiesCooperativeGroups; cooperativeGroupTrialCompanies covers both files.
 */
import type { CompanyInput } from "@/lib/schema";

